{"title": "Veteran Actor Nana Patekar Dies at 75", "summary": "Veteran actor Nana Patekar died at the age of 75 following a cardiac arrest at his residence in Goa. He was known for his cinematic legacy and was set to appear on the show ‘Kon Honar Crorepati’. Tributes poured in from various figures including Prime Minister Narendra Modi, who recalled his \"intensity, individuality and unmistakable presence,\" and political leaders like Kharge and Rahul Gandhi, who mourned his death and hailed his work. Former cricketer Basit Ali shared memories of Patekar's support during difficult times.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "वयोवृद्ध अभिनेता नाना पाटेकर का 75 वर्ष की आयु में निधन", "summary_hi": "वयोवृद्ध अभिनेता नाना पाटेकर का गोवा स्थित उनके आवास पर हृदय गति रुकने से 75 वर्ष की आयु में निधन हो गया। वह अपनी सिनेमाई विरासत के लिए जाने जाते थे और शो ‘कौन होणार करोडपती’ में दिखाई देने वाले थे। प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी सहित विभिन्न हस्तियों ने श्रद्धांजलि अर्पित की, जिन्होंने उनकी \"तीव्रता, व्यक्तित्व और विशिष्ट उपस्थिति\" को याद किया, और खड़गे और राहुल गांधी जैसे राजनीतिक नेताओं ने उनके निधन पर शोक व्यक्त किया और उनके काम की सराहना की। पूर्व क्रिकेटर बासित अली ने कठिन समय के दौरान पाटेकर के समर्थन की यादें साझा कीं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Mourned his death and hailed his cinematic legacy."], "center": ["Reported his death at age 75 from cardiac arrest at his Goa residence.", "Noted he was set to appear on ‘Kon Honar Crorepati’.", "Shared tributes from Prime Minister Narendra Modi, recalling his 'intensity, individuality and unmistakable presence'.", "Included former cricketer Basit Ali's memories of Patekar's support during his mother's illness."], "right": ["Raised the question of whether Nana Patekar predicted his own death."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["उनके निधन पर शोक व्यक्त किया और उनकी सिनेमाई विरासत की सराहना की।"], "center": ["गोवा स्थित उनके आवास पर 75 वर्ष की आयु में हृदय गति रुकने से उनके निधन की सूचना दी।", "उल्लेख किया कि वह ‘कौन होणार करोडपती’ में दिखाई देने वाले थे।", "प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी की श्रद्धांजलि को शामिल किया, जिन्होंने उनकी 'तीव्रता, व्यक्तित्व और विशिष्ट उपस्थिति' को याद किया।", "पूर्व क्रिकेटर बासित अली की अपनी माँ की बीमारी के दौरान पाटेकर के समर्थन की यादें शामिल कीं।"], "right": ["यह सवाल उठाया कि क्या नाना पाटेकर ने अपनी मौत की भविष्यवाणी की थी।"]}, "topic": "Society", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134815191,imgsize-174544.cms", "sources": [{"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Did Nana Patekar Predict His Own Death?"}, {"source": "The Free Press Journal", "owner": "The Free Press Journal", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Actor Nana Patekar Dies At 75 After Cardiac Arrest At Goa Residence"}, {"source": "DNA (Daily News & Analysis)", "owner": "DNA (Daily News & Analysis)", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE5tS0ZQMDFFNVI4VkxDNFozdlJjSVZYNWdSTExYZnRTM3NySEJvWUd6dllhYy1Dckt4WHB4QjQ4dzRIbGxOR1RuaU9hay1JdnV1YlZoUF9lbjlsWGtycFc3aUxDemppTGppdm96MHBZRQ?oc=5", "headline": "NANA PATEKAR SON MALHAR PATEKAR"}, {"source": "DNA (Daily News & Analysis)", "owner": "DNA (Daily News & Analysis)", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9EdG9Cc0RNR0ZlVDRUdXhIMGkwaTdpNEdhMFNnb1Eyd25hVk9XWng0ZEFxdkl0dUdIc183OHY2b1RBaUtTUjAzd0prRHNqdzlCVGVBd3NacWtzaXZYUWFaY2pJRTBOMHNtcGZCTDRR?oc=5", "headline": "NANA PATEKAR PASSES AWAY AT 75"}, {"source": "DNA (Daily News & Analysis)", "owner": "DNA (Daily News & Analysis)", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9tNFJTNkd6Q2pWQWhuZFdrYk1wRUZuNGY3LURCRkQ2Zll5YkJfLVA1Z0V0TjdKaVNiT3JsOVBTcEN2dVgzRGdoOUVuS01TOEFmVm14ZENJUElwUW5QLUZpOTVYbnozbEk?oc=5", "headline": "NANA PATEKAR 